    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho atumia fulani a Iziraeli aniedzera achisagala mbere zangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, atu aha, anamendza vizuka vyao mwao mioyoni na akaika uyi mbere. Dze, niariche aniuze mashauri kpweli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi aambire, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Mutu yeyesi wa Iziraeli amendzaye vizukavye mwakpwe moyoni na akaika uyi mbere, achedza kpwa nabii, mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu mwenye ndamjibu kulengana na vizukavye vinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindahenda hivi ili niweze kugbwira tsona mioyo ya atu a Iziraeli ambao aniricha achilunga vizuka vyao.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kpwa hivyo aambire atu a Iziraeli, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, ‘Tubuni chisha mriche vyo vizuka vyenu na go mahendo genu ga kutsukiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana chila mutu wa Iziraeli au mjeni asagalaye Iziraeli adzitengaye nami, amendzaye vizuka mwakpwe moyoni na kuika uyi mbere; chisha edze kpwa nabii ili kuniuza ushauri, mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nindamjibu mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindakala chinyume na mutu iye na nimuhende akale ishara na ndarira. Nindamtenga na atu angu, namwi mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ichikala ye nabii andachengeka na agombe utu, mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu ndimi ndiyemuhenda achengeke, chisha nindamgolosera mkpwono wangu na nimuangamize kahi-kahi ya atu angu Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho andatiywa adabu kpwa uyi wao, ye nabii andatiywa adabu sawa na ye chiyemlunga kumtaka ushauri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ili atu a Iziraeli asiangamike tsona, wala asidzinajisi tsona na uyi wao; ela akale atu angu nami nikale Mlungu wao, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami tsona achiniamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, tsi ichinikosera kpwa kukosa uaminifu nami nchigolosa mkpwono wangu chinyumeche na kuusa tegemeore ra chakurya na kuirehera ndzala na kuangamiza anadamu na nyama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "napho atu aha ahahu, Nuhu, Danieli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Danieli",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Danieli ni mutu wa ikima yemanyikana pho kare kpwa maishage ga haki. Danieli yuyu ni wanjina, si yuya Danieli nabii wa Mlungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na Ayubu angekalamo, aho angeokola maisha gao tu kpwa haki yao, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchireha nyama a tsakani avamie yo tsi, aolage atu osi a yo tsi na kuihenda gandzo; ikale mutu kaweza kutsupira tsi iyo kpwa nyo nyama a tsakani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kpwa kpweli dza niishivyo, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, hata aha atu ahahu angekalamo taangeokola ana ao, angeokolwa nyo enye tu, ela yo tsi ingekala gandzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au nchireha upanga chinyume cha yo tsi na kuamba, ‘Upanga, tsupa kahi-kahi ya tsi ihi ikale na viha na kuolaga atu na nyama aho mumo,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, kpwa kpweli dza niishivyo atu aha ahahu angekalamo taangeokola ana ao, ela angeokolwa nyo enye tu kpwa haki yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au nchireha ukongo kpwenye yo tsi na kuolaga atu kpwa tsukizi zangu, niaolage atu na nyama ao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hata Nuhu, Danieli na Ayubu angekalamo, kpwa kpweli dza niishivyo, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, asingeokola ana ao, angeokoka aho enye tu kpwa haki yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
