              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 6:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mana Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, ‘Indakaladze ndiphoreha hukumu zangu ne zirizo kali chinyume cha Jerusalemu, yani upanga, ndzala, nyama a tsakani na makongo ndigoolaga atu na nyama ao? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela phandasala anjina ambao andatiya, ana alume na achetu. Aho andakpwedza kpwenu, namwi mundiphoona njira na mahendo gao mundaphozwa marenda, kpwa vyo nrivyokureherani mafwa ko Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaphozwa marenda ndiphoona njira zao na mahendo gao, namwi mundamanya kukala si bure go nrigohendera nyo mudzi, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
